An absorbed colon fence leaves a block quote's paragraph open

```
> quote
> :::note
> body
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <p>quote
:::note
body</p>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> quote
> :::note
> body
> ::::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <p>quote
:::note
body</p>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> :::note
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <p>:::note</p>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> > quote
> > :::note
> > body
> > :::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>quote
:::note
body</p>
    <div>

    </div>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```
